---
import AdminShell from '../../components/AdminShell.astro';
---
<AdminShell title="Templates" eyebrow="Website Factory" description="Standardized foundations for fast, consistent customer website production." active="templates">
  <style>
    .template-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.template-card{overflow:hidden}.template-preview{height:120px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2d0b50,#6720ad);position:relative}.template-preview.service:after,.template-preview.pro:after,.template-preview.wellness:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:18px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16)}.template-preview.pro{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#24364b,#5b7188)}.template-preview.wellness{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7b3e72,#c078a8)}.template-body{padding:16px}.template-body h3{margin:8px 0 7px}.template-body p{margin:0;color:#807489;font-size:.77rem}.template-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #eee9f1;font-size:.7rem}.template-meta span{color:#8b7f91}.template-meta strong{display:block;color:#45304f;margin-top:2px}.standard{margin-top:14px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:14px}.checklist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.check{padding:10px 11px;border:1px solid #eee8f1;border-radius:10px;font-size:.73rem;color:#4f4356}.check:before{content:"✓";color:#178a47;font-weight:900;margin-right:7px}@media(max-width:950px){.template-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.standard{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.template-grid,.checklist{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
  <div class="template-grid"><section class="surface template-card"><div class="template-preview service"></div><div class="template-body"><span class="pill green">Primary</span><h3>Local Service Business</h3><p>Default structure for home services, trades, repair, cleaning, and local service operators.</p><div class="template-meta"><div><span>Pages</span><strong>5 standard</strong></div><div><span>Focus</span><strong>Lead generation</strong></div></div></div></section><section class="surface template-card"><div class="template-preview pro"></div><div class="template-body"><span class="pill">Available</span><h3>Professional Services</h3><p>Content-forward design for consultants, firms, and appointment-based professional businesses.</p><div class="template-meta"><div><span>Style</span><strong>Credibility</strong></div><div><span>Focus</span><strong>Services + trust</strong></div></div></div></section><section class="surface template-card"><div class="template-preview wellness"></div><div class="template-body"><span class="pill">Available</span><h3>Beauty & Wellness</h3><p>Visual-first variation for salons, massage, hair restoration, and appointment-driven businesses.</p><div class="template-meta"><div><span>Style</span><strong>Image forward</strong></div><div><span>Focus</span><strong>Booking CTA</strong></div></div></div></section></div>
  <div class="standard"><section class="surface"><div class="surface-head"><div><h3>Template Standard</h3><p>Every template inherits the same production requirements.</p></div><span class="pill gold">Standard</span></div><div class="surface-body"><div class="checklist"><div class="check">Mobile-first responsive layout</div><div class="check">Local SEO foundation</div><div class="check">SSL and secure hosting</div><div class="check">Contact or quote path</div><div class="check">Domain connection support</div><div class="check">Accessible semantic structure</div><div class="check">Reusable configuration content</div><div class="check">Customer review before launch</div></div></div></section><section class="surface"><div class="surface-head"><div><h3>Factory Direction</h3><p>Templates are foundations, not cookie-cutter finished sites.</p></div></div><div class="surface-body"><p style="margin:0;color:#6e6275;font-size:.8rem">Business research, verified facts, vertical presets, imagery, and customer content should create variation while preserving a repeatable production system.</p></div></section></div>
</AdminShell>